{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One S'More is a charming 3D single-player puzzle game that combines cute cartoon visuals with challenging gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683720/extras/One_Smore_Steam_04.gif?t=1728401459\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your marshmallow buddy through a world full of floating cookies, waffles, jelly and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683720/extras/One_Smore_Steam_03.gif?t=1728401459\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A simple click can split islands, break cookies and set the world into motion to rearrange entire levels, bringing the marshmallow closer to its goal of being squished between two chocolate cookies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683720/extras/One_Smore_Steam_05.gif?t=1728401459\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn mechanics serve as the base for a ton of unique levels with increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683720/extras/One_Smore_Steam_02.gif?t=1728401459\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still hungry for more after completing the campaign? You can create your own levels in the editor and share them with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683720/extras/One_Smore_Steam_06.gif?t=1728401459\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2683720?t=1728401459","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai